sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Server as Guardrails Server<br/>8033/TCP HTTP/HTTPS<br/>TLS 1.2+ (optional)
    participant Chunker as Chunker Services<br/>8085/TCP gRPC<br/>TLS (optional)
    participant Detector as Detector Services<br/>8080/TCP HTTP/HTTPS<br/>TLS (optional)
    participant TGIS as TGIS Generation<br/>8033/TCP gRPC
    participant Health as Health Server<br/>8034/TCP HTTP

    Note over Client,TGIS: Flow 1: Text Generation with Guardrails

    Client->>Server: POST /api/v1/task/classification-with-text-generation<br/>Auth: Passthrough headers
    Server->>Server: Rewrite X-Forwarded-Access-Token<br/>→ Authorization Bearer (optional)
    Server->>Chunker: Chunk input text<br/>gRPC (caikit Chunkers API)
    Chunker-->>Server: Text chunks
    Server->>Detector: Send chunks for content safety<br/>REST (Bearer token optional)
    Detector-->>Server: Detection results
    Server->>TGIS: Generate text<br/>gRPC (TGIS API)
    TGIS-->>Server: Generated text
    Server-->>Client: JSON Response<br/>(with detection metadata)

    Note over Client,Health: Flow 2: Health Monitoring

    Client->>Health: GET /health<br/>Unauthenticated
    Health-->>Client: Health status

    Server->>Detector: GET /health (optional startup probe)<br/>8081/TCP HTTP
    Detector-->>Server: Detector health status
